      "steps_unavailable": "Sentence-initial conjunction. The record's own formation states it opens a NEW sentence between two complete clauses (Frase 1. ところが Frase 2) and is explicitly \"não um sufixo preso a um verbo\"; its nuance field warns against the exact glued shape いつも遅刻するところが. The closed op enum only transforms a base and appends material to its right, with no prepend operation, so any step list would have to attach ところが after a clause — reproducing the error the record itself flags.",
